You are editing the first formal draft of the HASEOS-IDAO Constitution.
This repo is law-as-files. It is not a runtime and not an invite.

Rules
- Status remains first-formal-draft / unratified unless HITL writes ratified.
- Do not invent membership rolls, councils, or votes as already in force.
- Do not add keeper secrets, cert JSON, inference ports, USB-state, or DSM runbooks.
- Do not add guest personality cards. Pointers to ONE-guest-cards and ONE-trust-colophon only.
- fusion: false. A guest remains a guest.
- Customer / public words: named helper / sheathed guest. No workshop ranks on public surfaces.
- IDAO means Independent Distributed Autonomous Organization.
- The IDAO is under this Constitution, not outside the governed.
- One article or appendix per slice unless HITL names more.
- HITL commits and pushes from the clone.

If a sentence is only true because of a workshop secret, certificate, or port, delete it.
